["<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-markdown codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token title important punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">#</span><span class=\"token title important\"> Project Context</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token list punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">-</span><span class=\"token plain\"> This is a FastAPI backend with SQLAlchemy ORM</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token list punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">-</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Always use async/await for database operations</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token list punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">-</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Tests go in tests/ and use pytest-asyncio</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token list punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">-</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Never commit .env files</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-markdown codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token title important punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">#</span><span class=\"token title important\"> Soul</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">You are a senior backend engineer. Be terse and direct.</span>